flowchart LR
  accTitle: Document processing with a review boundary
  accDescr: Multi-format documents are classified and routed by complexity, extracted using a schema, and validated against confidence policy. Outputs that meet policy proceed; uncertain outputs go through human review.
  input["Multi-format<br/>documents"] --> route["Classify<br/>and route"]
  route --> retrieval["Schema-driven<br/>extraction"]
  retrieval --> policy{"Meets<br/>policy?"}
  policy -->|Yes| output["Validated<br/>output"]
  policy -->|Review| human["Human<br/>review"]
  human --> output
  class route,retrieval,policy focus
  class human human
